{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Not a bad instinct, Apgan was it?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:15:03.783000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867303649583169547","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Yes.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:15:20.728000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867303720656437258","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"I hope so. We've needed true patriots in that office for a long long time, Nolan.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:15:34.508000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867303778453946368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Listen to it. When that office stops speaking, its likely you've lost your way.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:16:08.439000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867303920769957888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"As for criminal informants. There is a Giff I know. Works at the moorage in manhattan. He moves materials smuggled through the Noir and distributes them around the city.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:17:38.796000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867304299753898014","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"He gives a nod.","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:17:49.024000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867304342653763584","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"He's a lumberjacked named Little Geoff.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:18:00.284000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867304389881888798","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
