{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"I asked him about the jewelry!\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:18:51.606000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867304605142482996","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"(looking back, he must have been very clever to disguise corruption like this.)","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:19:01.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867304646723764244","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"I asked him if he knew anything about the Clutter woman's jewelry!\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:19:41.332000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867304813707264000","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"The tree is a call and response password. Its a warning of sorts. If buchanan had it, well thats bad news for Empire.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:19:45.517000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867304831260557322","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"“What lies be-neath…. Is code, not lit-er-al?”","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:21:08.405000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867305178918289428","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Its quite a grave code. Thank you for this information. I hope I can stop it in time.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:21:45.893000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867305336155406347","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"“What is… the mean-ing?”","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:22:34.475000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867305539922034709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Good luck to you sir.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:22:41.181000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867305568049037312","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
