{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:23:46.193000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867305840729391134","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"He raises an eyebrow at Nolan. \"Why don't you tell me a little more about who the Office picked.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:24:26.307000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867306008979308555","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"“Um… me. And Ap-gan, who has desk.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:24:58.507000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867306144037208064","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"I think he wants to know more about why he can trust you. Who is Nolan Reeve, exactly?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:26:02.078000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867306410673307708","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"The tiefling nods to Apgan.","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:26:26.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867306513823563786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"**These two scouts sounded like they were on the up and up, but could they really be trusted? could any lamplighter?**","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:27:29.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867306777027936306","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"“Was large, many arms… sac-ri-fice self to ra-vens to re-turn friend… small now as result… one arm… am priest of Web… I care much for this… city. And its people. The gun liked me…. And then the build-ing wrote my name… oh! I wrote in post.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:28:32.165000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T07:29:01.316000Z","id":"867307040182763530","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"I've known him for a week and I only know two things about him. When Aljarad Smith needed help finding missing people in Hampstead, he volunteered. When the building chose him to light lamps, he did it by himself for many days, without a lick of help from anyone.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:29:19.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867307238573211669","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"“Be-fore this ci-ty I live in cave in Vir-gin-i-a. Like the city… much better. Less lone-ly.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:30:09.193000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T07:30:33.054000Z","id":"867307447147560971","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Aljarad Smith may be a known loyalist, but I know enough to know what someone who's just trying to do the right thing looks like.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:30:42.150000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T07:31:08.385000Z","id":"867307585380024330","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"“And Ap-gan sac-ri-ficed self for us in sew-ers. He lit lamps with out any ask-ing. He risks life again and a-gain if there is chance… to save a life.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:32:07.087000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867307941630705684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"That you dealt with the ravens bodes well. They are on our side, mostly.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:32:34.788000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867308057816727562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"and lighting the lamps is something we are thankful to not have to do.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:33:13.563000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T07:33:18.737000Z","id":"867308220451389472","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"If it's not to much to ask, we don't need to know what the code means. We just want to know how we can help prevent a disaster, if one is coming.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:34:50.022000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867308625030414366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Wait.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:34:57.122000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867308654808793108","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"I went to the lamplighters.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:35:03.212000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867308680353677333","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"I am such a fool--we were in the noir, before the redcoats attack came.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:35:38.712000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T07:37:12.971000Z","id":"867308829251207178","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"We saw a vision of Oro, who warned us that the redcoats would come through the noir.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:36:09.449000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867308958170611723","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"The next day I went to the lamplighters to warn them, to tell them of that vision.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:36:40.841000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867309089838858240","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Oro? You are a message barer for a Warden? Interesting.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:36:54.903000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T07:37:04.868000Z","id":"867309148818767872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"There is another, 'Sonny,' or 'Cairn.' A friend of Finn Midask's who also was there when the message was given.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:37:54.616000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867309399273766952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"But I told the lamplighters, because I could not find the minutemen. And so the message never reached the minutemen, did it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:38:41.162000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867309594501447680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Very doubtful.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:39:00.235000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867309674499407873","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Then Buchanan was fully aware of the attack, a spy for the redcoats. He's alive, corrupt, a spy, and he knows something about the Clutters.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:40:04.392000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867309943592714281","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"Apgan begins to clench his fists.","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:40:30.640000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867310053685985290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"“We must… find him.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:40:34.879000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867310071464984587","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Under the spreading Chestnut tree, I sold you and you sold me. The message is betrayal. Some one important plans to betray washington.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:41:06.690000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867310204890644480","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Then I know who to talk to.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:41:36.387000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867310329448628224","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"Nolan clenches his fist. “We must find out *who*.”","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:41:58.515000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867310422260187167","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Seems to me that you are taking to this like duck to water, there Scout.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:43:01.808000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867310687729483776","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850803603857735680","content":"\"Thank you very much for the information sir. Buchanan, Washington, and the Giff. All of it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:43:19.522000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867310762027122688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
